elations        = \n| base             = [[Organization Central]] \n| group            = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| first appearance = \"[[The Mission]]\" (Flashback)\n| hair color      = Black<br>Brown<br>Grey\n| last appearance  = \n| signature spells = \n| signature titans = \n| voice actor      = \n| see also         = \n}}\n'''{{PAGENAME}}''' were the five strongest operatives of [[the Professor]] and his personal protective body. They received a mission from the Professor to bring [[Eathon Lambert]] to him. They followed and trailed him all across the world, battling at the gates of [[Atlantis]], until they cornered him at a waterfall in the forests of [[Peru]]. {{source|The Mission}} They turned Eathon over to the Professor, but Eathon managed to escape by jumping from the waterfall and using the [[Nexus]] to enter [[Spirit World|Huntik]]. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}\n{{Clear}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nThese operatives were exceptionally powerful, with the power readings of their [[Boltflare]] castings said to be off the scale. {{source|Coming of Age}}\n{{Col-begin}}{{Col-2}}\n===Spells Utilized ===\n*[[Boltflare]] {{source|Coming of Age}}\n{{Col-2}}\n===Bonded Titans===\n*[[Bonelasher]] {{Source|Coming of Age}}\n{{Col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Suits]]\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:5147","status":"resolved","target_title":"Organization Central","label":"Organization Central","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Organization_Central","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5147"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"h